  "details": "It seems that the \"Active My Platform\" world category was removed a while back, and merged into \"Active Cross Platform\".\n\nRecently this has been taken a step further, with now the \"Active Cross Platform\" tab also being gone. This leaves \"Trending\" worlds as the only option, which tends to be a bit of a confusing and oddly ordered mess.\n\nCan we get both of the Active tabs back so that we can once again see the most active worlds? It can be near the bottom of the list for all I care, I just want an overview of the most active worlds, not just the ones that are currently \"Trending\".",
